      en: ["Natural depth reaches up to 19 meters at its deepest berths.", "Directly linked to the 892 km long Carajás Railroad (EFC).", "Handles an annual cargo volume exceeding 30 million tons.", "Primary export hub for iron ore from the Carajás mining project.", "Managed by EMAP (Maranhão Port Administration Company).", "Major hub for the import and distribution of liquid fuels in Northern Brazil."],
