      en: ["The plant was officially inaugurated on July 9, 1976.", "It was the first Fiat factory in Brazil, breaking the monopoly in the state of São Paulo.", "The facility features its own test track for new prototypes.", "Betim houses the largest engine plant of the Stellantis Group in South America.", "Over 50 different vehicle models have been produced here over the decades.", "On average, approximately 3,000 vehicles leave the assembly lines every day."],
